Package: AEC
Type: Package
Title: Documented Teaching Data for Econometrics and Statistics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Jean-Paul", "Renne", email = "jean-paul.renne@unil.ch",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Frozen, documented datasets for teaching statistics, regression,
    panel data, prediction, and time series. Source-specific rights notices,
    provenance, transformations, and compact construction inputs accompany
    the datasets. Econometric procedures are maintained separately in IdSS.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: The MIT licence covers package software and construction code.
    Third-party data retain the separate terms in inst/DATA-SOURCES.md.
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
URL: https://github.com/jrenne/AEC
BugReports: https://github.com/jrenne/AEC/issues
